      "punte": [
        "fix: [taal] in 'Eers suig die saad water in en dan swel dit dikker op.': Missing AWS comma between two full clauses joined by 'en dan'.",
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'So 'n plant verlep heeltemal en gaan later dood.': The condition (the soil stays dry even longer) is only implied, so the sentence can read as saying every drooping plant dies; restoring it means choosing content, so it goes to the writer.",
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Jy plant twee sade. Die een pot staan in die warm son en die ander een': 'Die een pot' has no antecedent, because pots were never mentioned; fixing it means adding that each seed is in its own pot, which is a content choice.",
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Kyk elke week mooi wat met die twee plantjies gebeur.': The block plants 'n paar boontjies' plus one cutting, so 'die twee plantjies' does not match what was planted; probably the two pots are meant, but correcting it means guessing the intent."
      ]
